WEBVTT

00:00:16.060 --> 00:00:19.690
The rest is for the police to handle.
Let them investigate all they want.

00:00:20.070 --> 00:00:22.950
If something comes up,
Fallon will call you immediately.

00:00:23.450 --> 00:00:26.370
I'm sorry we're late.
We had to deal with a strange guy.

00:00:26.910 --> 00:00:29.830
Jeez. You almost got us killed.

00:00:30.080 --> 00:00:31.750
And so, I'm apologizing.

00:02:23.730 --> 00:02:28.450
Major. Perhaps you should wait,
until you get back to Kudan.

00:02:29.200 --> 00:02:32.120
The administrative work I do here
is also an important job.

00:02:32.570 --> 00:02:33.410
So?

00:02:34.240 --> 00:02:37.040
Dr. Hanada is missing,
since the incident yesterday.

00:02:37.370 --> 00:02:40.960
The maid was found murdered
at a former factory site.

00:02:41.630 --> 00:02:45.050
Also, according to the doctor's
seven-year-old daughter,

00:02:45.460 --> 00:02:47.510
the doctor turned into glowing ash
and disappeared.

00:02:48.130 --> 00:02:49.260
Glowing ash?

00:02:50.470 --> 00:02:52.760
You're right. This is clearly
not the place to discuss this.

00:02:53.140 --> 00:02:55.720
It looks like V Shipping were there, too.

00:02:56.100 --> 00:02:59.180
Actually,
I heard that you made contact with them.

00:02:59.270 --> 00:03:00.100
Yes.

00:03:01.310 --> 00:03:02.650
Is it them?

00:03:02.850 --> 00:03:03.940
Don't be hasty.

00:03:04.230 --> 00:03:07.320
They are certainly deeply involved
in the incidents,

00:03:07.820 --> 00:03:10.280
but there are other organizations
to suspect, too.

00:03:11.360 --> 00:03:12.610
Alma Trading Company?

00:03:15.160 --> 00:03:18.080
The sum of the square root of X
and square root of Y is T.

00:03:18.290 --> 00:03:20.250
And the sum of X and Y shall be S.

00:03:21.080 --> 00:03:23.670
When you substitute this
into the previous equation,

00:03:23.750 --> 00:03:26.000
the sum of T and S will be six.

00:03:26.250 --> 00:03:29.170
<i>Even today, just thinking about it</i>
<i>gives me the chills.</i>

00:03:30.220 --> 00:03:32.180
<i>Who was Yuliy fighting there?</i>

00:03:32.590 --> 00:03:35.010
<i>Rather, what was he fighting?</i>

00:03:35.100 --> 00:03:37.970
Hence, ST will equal five...

00:03:44.940 --> 00:03:46.400
You're in love, I suspect.

00:03:47.230 --> 00:03:48.820
Makie and Shino.

00:03:49.070 --> 00:03:51.280
That's totally a love sigh.

00:03:52.200 --> 00:03:53.700
No. Not at all.

00:03:53.950 --> 00:03:55.570
It's nothing like that.

00:04:00.080 --> 00:04:02.460
-You're definitely in love.
-You're definitely in love.

00:04:17.430 --> 00:04:19.140
This part of the imperial capital

00:04:19.220 --> 00:04:20.810
is rather quiet, isn't it?

00:04:21.390 --> 00:04:22.230
You're right.

00:04:24.100 --> 00:04:28.650
Saki's relative is going to take her in.

00:04:30.110 --> 00:04:31.690
I'm sure she will be fine.

00:04:32.820 --> 00:04:33.650
I'm not so sure.

00:04:35.320 --> 00:04:38.030
He was so important for her,
as he was her only family.

00:04:38.280 --> 00:04:40.830
But her beloved father was murdered.

00:04:42.200 --> 00:04:45.670
What can we do?
You made the right decision.

00:04:46.790 --> 00:04:48.460
I would've done the...

00:04:51.250 --> 00:04:53.420
You're not your usual self.

00:04:54.470 --> 00:04:56.470
You're the one who's acting weird.

00:04:56.760 --> 00:04:58.510
You're making me feel awkward.

00:04:59.550 --> 00:05:00.390
Idiot.

00:05:07.770 --> 00:05:09.940
<i>Important... family.</i>

00:05:31.840 --> 00:05:32.880
Nice try, Yuliy.

00:05:33.670 --> 00:05:34.510
Great.

00:05:41.600 --> 00:05:44.390
I was so close to catching a big one.

00:05:44.470 --> 00:05:46.980
Either way,
I'm the only one who can carry it.

00:05:47.690 --> 00:05:49.770
If only had I not sneezed at that moment.

00:05:49.850 --> 00:05:51.860
You really can't take the cold, can you?

00:05:52.480 --> 00:05:54.610
Use this to make yourself
some new clothes.

00:05:55.190 --> 00:05:57.860
But you caught it. It's not mine.

00:05:58.990 --> 00:06:02.120
We could say that you caught it,
if you'd like.

00:06:02.740 --> 00:06:04.370
-Really?
-Not.

00:06:04.700 --> 00:06:07.660
If you don't like it,
try to catch one before me next time.

00:06:10.000 --> 00:06:11.000
Come on. Hurry up.

00:06:19.590 --> 00:06:21.010
This is impressive.

00:06:21.510 --> 00:06:24.600
We'll have enough to feed everyone
and make tools for a while.

00:06:24.970 --> 00:06:27.430
We'll have a feast
at the chief's place tonight.

00:06:28.020 --> 00:06:30.440
A feast? A feast at Gustav's place?

00:06:30.690 --> 00:06:33.060
Hey, hey.
How many times do I need to remind you

00:06:33.150 --> 00:06:35.110
that my house isn't a banquet room?

00:06:36.780 --> 00:06:37.610
Yuliy.

00:06:38.030 --> 00:06:40.240
Don't call him Gustav. Call him chief.

00:06:40.700 --> 00:06:41.740
Mother.

00:06:43.240 --> 00:06:45.580
That's a big one. Who caught it?

00:06:46.200 --> 00:06:47.040
Yuliy did.

00:06:47.250 --> 00:06:48.790
Wow, that's impressive.

00:06:49.290 --> 00:06:51.250
I assumed it was Mikhail.

00:06:51.920 --> 00:06:55.250
Great job, Yuliy.
And you're still just a little boy.

00:06:55.750 --> 00:06:58.010
Right, we should have a big feast tonight,

00:06:58.090 --> 00:06:59.840
to show our gratitude to you.

00:07:00.590 --> 00:07:04.930
No. That's not what happened.
Mikhail killed it.

00:07:22.610 --> 00:07:24.990
I haven't had a great time like this
in a while.

00:07:26.160 --> 00:07:29.750
But then again, this living room
has unfortunately now become big enough

00:07:29.830 --> 00:07:33.170
for the whole tribe to feast in together.

00:07:34.210 --> 00:07:38.460
Mikhail and Yuliy are now
the only young ones here.

00:07:39.920 --> 00:07:43.300
Now that the Ark of Sirius,
which our tribe must protect, is gone,

00:07:43.800 --> 00:07:48.390
perhaps it is our fate to die out
in the current of time.

00:07:48.850 --> 00:07:51.060
Chief.
You could at least say something like,

00:07:51.230 --> 00:07:56.900
"The young ones shall leave the village
to broaden their horizons."

00:07:59.610 --> 00:08:01.280
You sure are the son of Alexei.

00:08:01.610 --> 00:08:04.910
You old people get so gloomy
when you drink.

00:08:05.570 --> 00:08:06.410
Mother.

00:08:06.870 --> 00:08:08.990
Is the Ark of Sirius gone?

00:08:09.580 --> 00:08:10.870
Hey. You were awake?

00:08:10.950 --> 00:08:12.460
It's not gone.

00:08:13.420 --> 00:08:15.080
It's simply not here.

00:08:16.250 --> 00:08:20.050
You two shall one day go protect the Ark.

00:08:20.130 --> 00:08:20.960
Chief.

00:08:21.630 --> 00:08:24.590
At least then they could leave Dogville.

00:08:25.590 --> 00:08:26.430
Where is it?

00:08:27.050 --> 00:08:29.640
-Our neighboring village?
-Somewhere much farther.

00:08:30.220 --> 00:08:33.270
-Mongolia?
-Much much farther than that.

00:08:34.600 --> 00:08:35.900
I don't get it.

00:08:37.560 --> 00:08:39.860
What will you do
when you find out where the Ark is?

00:08:40.360 --> 00:08:44.780
I'll protect it.
I'll protect it, and Mother, too.

00:08:45.570 --> 00:08:46.450
Yuliy...

00:08:46.990 --> 00:08:51.830
I might as well protect you, Gustav,
and the villagers, as well, and...

00:08:58.040 --> 00:09:00.340
You're a dependable Sirius.

00:09:00.420 --> 00:09:01.550
That's for sure.

00:09:01.630 --> 00:09:03.800
I mean,
this is what he does when it counts.

00:09:03.880 --> 00:09:05.720
You can't stand the cold, can you?

00:09:06.510 --> 00:09:10.720
Oh, yes. And that's why
I'm making a present for you right now.

00:09:11.140 --> 00:09:12.970
What? What is it? What is it?

00:09:14.230 --> 00:09:15.810
You'll know when it's finished.

00:09:16.350 --> 00:09:18.900
Come on. Tell me. What is it?

00:09:19.400 --> 00:09:20.770
He's a dependable puppy.

00:09:32.370 --> 00:09:33.790
<i>The Ark of Sirius.</i>

00:09:54.310 --> 00:09:55.640
Hola, Yuliy.

00:09:56.520 --> 00:09:58.940
How's your wound?

00:09:59.440 --> 00:10:00.650
Yes, it's fine.

00:10:01.230 --> 00:10:02.070
Really?

00:10:03.480 --> 00:10:04.780
I fixed your coat.

00:10:05.190 --> 00:10:06.030
Thank you.

00:10:10.950 --> 00:10:13.370
Well, let me know if you need anything.

00:10:14.040 --> 00:10:14.870
Ciao.

00:10:25.550 --> 00:10:29.180
Hey, Yuliy. I'm getting something to eat.
Would you like to tag along?

00:10:29.510 --> 00:10:30.930
Sorry. I think I'll pass.

00:10:32.720 --> 00:10:33.560
I understand.

00:10:33.850 --> 00:10:36.270
We'll go some other time,
when you feel like it.

00:10:36.680 --> 00:10:37.850
Yes. Thanks.

00:10:47.440 --> 00:10:50.110
I'm going out for a while.
Go ahead and eat without...

00:10:50.200 --> 00:10:51.950
Hey, Yuliy, what, are you alone?

00:10:53.580 --> 00:10:56.450
-What's wrong?
-No. It's nothing.

00:11:02.040 --> 00:11:04.290
What happened
to Dr. Hanada was unfortunate.

00:11:05.380 --> 00:11:06.340
Saki, too.

00:11:07.840 --> 00:11:11.800
I've done to Saki
what the Vampires did to my family,

00:11:12.680 --> 00:11:14.510
back in Dogville.

00:11:16.510 --> 00:11:17.350
And...

00:11:20.730 --> 00:11:24.900
She said that it's too late for you now
to be drawn to the Ark?

00:11:25.480 --> 00:11:26.320
Yes.

00:11:26.980 --> 00:11:28.400
Right before the Royal died.

00:11:29.940 --> 00:11:33.740
They might have come
to Japan looking for the Ark.

00:11:44.630 --> 00:11:46.250
Yuliy. Yuliy, are you awake?

00:11:47.840 --> 00:11:48.670
Mikhail?

00:11:49.260 --> 00:11:50.090
Mikhail?

00:11:57.180 --> 00:11:58.010
Mother?

00:12:02.310 --> 00:12:03.140
What is this?

00:12:04.350 --> 00:12:06.440
-A monster?
-A Vampire.

00:12:08.820 --> 00:12:10.030
Vampire?

00:12:17.450 --> 00:12:19.370
The bleeding. It's not stopping.

00:12:23.290 --> 00:12:24.120
Misha.

00:12:24.830 --> 00:12:28.710
Take Yuliy, and leave now.

00:12:36.640 --> 00:12:37.470
Mikhail.

00:12:38.140 --> 00:12:40.970
We have to treat her.
Or else she's going to die.

00:12:42.020 --> 00:12:42.850
Mother.

00:12:46.940 --> 00:12:47.770
Yuliy.

00:12:57.450 --> 00:12:58.280
Survive.

00:12:59.160 --> 00:13:00.580
Survive. Okay?

00:13:04.410 --> 00:13:05.750
My sweet little...

00:13:06.330 --> 00:13:07.170
Yulichka.

00:13:11.340 --> 00:13:12.170
Mother?

00:13:13.340 --> 00:13:16.550
-Mother? Mother?
-Come on, Yuliy.

00:13:16.800 --> 00:13:19.470
-No. We're taking Mother with us.
-Yuliy.

00:13:21.180 --> 00:13:23.270
Do what Mother said to do.

00:13:36.700 --> 00:13:38.570
You're strong, Yuliy.

00:13:51.540 --> 00:13:52.800
Dogville.

00:13:53.420 --> 00:13:56.720
Our destined land, and...

00:13:58.220 --> 00:14:01.180
the place of extinction for the Sirius.

00:14:02.680 --> 00:14:04.140
For about 1000 years,

00:14:04.810 --> 00:14:09.440
we Vampires secretly ruled this world.

00:14:10.020 --> 00:14:12.400
And for the next 1000 years, as well.

00:14:13.110 --> 00:14:16.360
As we reign at the top of the ecosystem,

00:14:16.780 --> 00:14:20.200
we have the responsibility
to lead the fools.

00:14:20.820 --> 00:14:23.790
And to do so, we need their Ark.

00:14:25.950 --> 00:14:28.120
Isn't that so, humans?

00:14:30.880 --> 00:14:31.920
The Ark, huh?

00:14:32.840 --> 00:14:36.260
If I came here because
I'm gravitating toward the Ark...

00:14:37.090 --> 00:14:40.010
-my older brother must be doing the same.
-Older brother?

00:14:41.970 --> 00:14:43.390
At Dr. Hanada's house...

00:14:44.640 --> 00:14:45.560
I saw my brother.

00:14:47.980 --> 00:14:48.810
Mikhail.

00:14:49.350 --> 00:14:51.150
-Yes?
-What happened to the chief

00:14:51.230 --> 00:14:52.150
and the villagers?

00:14:52.980 --> 00:14:55.360
I don't know.
But considering the situation,

00:14:55.440 --> 00:14:58.650
we can't go back to the village,
and we're not safe here, either.

00:15:00.990 --> 00:15:01.910
Don't worry.

00:15:02.780 --> 00:15:04.410
I'll protect you no matter what.

00:15:05.870 --> 00:15:07.870
-Yeah.
-Let's go, Yuliy.

00:15:12.580 --> 00:15:15.040
Say, Mikhail. Isn't it too quiet?

00:15:21.380 --> 00:15:22.220
Yuliy.

00:15:23.890 --> 00:15:24.890
When you're hunting,

00:15:25.640 --> 00:15:28.060
and it gets awfully quiet like this,
use caution.

00:15:28.810 --> 00:15:29.890
Always remember that.

00:15:31.520 --> 00:15:32.350
Yeah. Okay.

00:15:32.690 --> 00:15:34.810
And don't use your gun.

00:15:35.690 --> 00:15:37.610
-It dulls your sense of smell.
-Okay.

00:15:39.240 --> 00:15:40.070
Also...

00:15:40.860 --> 00:15:43.200
don't eat anything sweet
before going to sleep.

00:15:43.990 --> 00:15:46.450
Your perfect teeth will be infested
with cavities.

00:15:46.530 --> 00:15:49.450
-Wait. Why are you telling me...?
-One more thing, Yuliy.

00:15:51.080 --> 00:15:51.910
Survive.

00:16:11.430 --> 00:16:12.270
Mikhail.

00:16:19.230 --> 00:16:20.610
Mikhail!

00:16:21.110 --> 00:16:22.200
-Mikhail.
-Get away.

00:16:34.420 --> 00:16:36.500
His appearance had changed.

00:16:37.590 --> 00:16:39.840
<i>But I could tell from his eyes...</i>
<i>his scars...</i>

00:16:40.000 --> 00:16:42.050
<i>and his voice when he called me.</i>

00:16:43.550 --> 00:16:44.380
In that case,

00:16:45.050 --> 00:16:48.050
he might have made a blood pact
with the Vampires.

00:16:50.520 --> 00:16:54.350
Right now I can't tolerate myself.

00:16:55.480 --> 00:16:59.400
It was right after I made Saki go through
the same pain I went through

00:16:59.480 --> 00:17:01.110
by killing Dr. Hanada.

00:17:02.150 --> 00:17:03.570
And yet I felt happiness.

00:17:05.450 --> 00:17:06.990
When I saw Mikhail,

00:17:07.700 --> 00:17:09.530
I couldn't help but feel happy...

00:17:10.700 --> 00:17:13.580
even if he was a Vampire.

00:17:15.330 --> 00:17:17.790
Even though
I had sworn to exterminate them,

00:17:18.420 --> 00:17:20.000
now I'm having second thoughts.

00:17:20.800 --> 00:17:22.960
I'm not sure
I could kill my older brother.

00:17:24.220 --> 00:17:27.220
My brother who became a Vampire,
all because he protected me.

00:17:28.300 --> 00:17:30.810
Would I be able to kill him,
like I did Dr. Hanada?

00:17:31.930 --> 00:17:33.600
Professor. What...?

00:17:34.980 --> 00:17:36.690
What am I supposed to do?

00:19:00.270 --> 00:19:01.810
-Yuliy?
-Get away.

00:19:14.240 --> 00:19:17.620
-You're not afraid?
-No.

00:19:27.630 --> 00:19:29.170
-Sorry.
-That's okay.

00:19:38.470 --> 00:19:41.390
It gets cold too suddenly in this country.

00:19:44.560 --> 00:19:46.900
Yuliy... I...

00:19:47.780 --> 00:19:49.320
came to visit you,

00:19:49.860 --> 00:19:50.950
when you got injured.

00:19:52.030 --> 00:19:53.530
And I...

00:19:53.860 --> 00:19:54.700
You saw me?

00:19:56.740 --> 00:19:57.870
Then you know well...

00:19:58.410 --> 00:20:00.540
that you should stay away from me.

00:20:01.250 --> 00:20:02.120
Yuliy...

00:20:02.210 --> 00:20:03.960
I'm a Jaeger.

00:20:05.670 --> 00:20:07.670
<i>This is what I decided for myself.</i>

00:20:31.030 --> 00:20:34.240
-You're quick to empty your glass tonight.
-Yeah.

00:20:35.110 --> 00:20:37.740
That's what happens
when I think about what happened.

00:20:39.330 --> 00:20:41.330
It was a windy day like today.

00:20:42.500 --> 00:20:45.960
I always ask myself one question
on a day like this:

00:20:47.540 --> 00:20:51.300
"Did I have the right to say what I did?"

00:21:06.270 --> 00:21:08.860
At least drink some water,
if you don't want to die.

00:21:09.900 --> 00:21:10.730
I'd like to die,

00:21:10.820 --> 00:21:12.900
if it means seeing my brother
and mother again.

00:21:15.450 --> 00:21:18.990
If that's their wish, do as you please.

00:21:20.160 --> 00:21:21.740
But that's not the case, is it?

00:21:34.720 --> 00:21:37.180
Then what am I supposed to do?

00:21:39.470 --> 00:21:40.930
How am I supposed to live?

00:21:45.430 --> 00:21:46.390
I might...

00:21:49.360 --> 00:21:51.110
be able to teach you how.

00:21:54.820 --> 00:21:55.900
EPISODE 3
INDELIBLE MEMORIES

00:23:34.210 --> 00:23:36.130
Well, well. Mr. Kershner.

00:23:36.210 --> 00:23:37.670
What a surprise.

00:23:38.010 --> 00:23:39.130
How is it looking?

00:23:39.760 --> 00:23:41.630
Yes, as you can see,

00:23:41.720 --> 00:23:44.930
it's completely connected,
from its head all the way to its tail.

00:23:45.140 --> 00:23:47.600
Although there isn't a tail,
in the literal sense.

00:23:48.930 --> 00:23:52.850
In other words, it's finally complete.
Finished.

00:23:59.320 --> 00:24:02.150
<i>-What do we do about The Hyakko Party?</i>
<i>-Export of weapons and technology?</i>

00:24:02.240 --> 00:24:04.950
<i>-We must solve this problem before...</i>
<i>-I smell blood.</i>

00:24:05.030 --> 00:24:07.200
<i>We look forward to your support</i>
<i>of Alma Trading Company.</i>

00:24:07.280 --> 00:24:08.450
EPISODE 4
BEGINNING OF TRICKERY

00:24:16.460 --> 00:24:21.470
Subtitle translation by Kozo Komori
